## Title: ForeverCombatTimers
## Notes: Combat timers for WoW: Forever in one block - the target's cast and the next enemy hit grow up from a seam, your main hand, off hand, ranged swings, buff timer and your own cast grow down from it. Every bar: always / when used / never, size, order.
